Rooks Hermes Gateway plugin

The way this plugin drives a Hermes gateway run (an Idempotency-Key on
POST /v1/runs, the run id kept with the turn, a ~120 s watchdog for which a
keepalive proves the stream alive but not progressing, GET /v1/runs/{id} as
the arbiter of a turn's end, and approvals deduplicated and settled when the
run ends) is ported from the gateway client of Hermes Web UI,
api/gateway_chat.py, https://github.com/nesquena/hermes-webui, distributed
